1
00:00:00,201 --> 00:00:02,171
(Amy:)Thank you for doing this.

2
00:00:02,236 --> 00:00:03,336
(Bernadette:)Our pleasure.

3
00:00:03,404 --> 00:00:04,604
(Bernadette:)You feeling okay?

4
00:00:04,672 --> 00:00:06,672
(Amy:)We were together for so long,

5
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,110
(Amy:)I honestly don't know
what I'm feeling.

6
00:00:09,177 --> 00:00:11,247
(Howard:)Well, that's
understandable.

7
00:00:11,312 --> 00:00:13,782
(Howard:)You forgot.
It's called "happy."

8
00:00:13,848 --> 00:00:15,218
(Amy:)Howard.

9
00:00:15,283 --> 00:00:16,313
(Howard:)I'm not saying
anything bad.

10
00:00:16,384 --> 00:00:18,484
(Howard:)Just that she was in love
with her captor

11
00:00:18,552 --> 00:00:21,822
(Howard:)and somehow managed to escape
from his dark and crazy dungeon.

12
00:00:23,491 --> 00:00:24,661
(Stuart:)I know
what you're going through.

13
00:00:24,725 --> 00:00:27,125
My-my last breakup
was pretty tough.

14
00:00:27,194 --> 00:00:29,394
(Amy:)Oh. What was her name?

15
00:00:29,463 --> 00:00:30,563
(Stuart:)Hey, it's a true story.

16
00:00:30,631 --> 00:00:32,661
(Stuart:)I don't need the third degree.

17
00:00:34,067 --> 00:00:35,267
(gasps)

18
00:00:37,638 --> 00:00:40,438
(Bernadette:)For God's sake, Sheldon,
what are you doing?

19
00:00:40,508 --> 00:00:42,038
(Sheldon:)I didn't want
to come in.

20
00:00:42,108 --> 00:00:45,208
(Sheldon:)I was told it would make
everyone feel uncomfortable.

21
00:00:45,979 --> 00:00:47,179
(Sheldon:)So I'll just stay out here

22
00:00:47,246 --> 00:00:49,546
(Sheldon:)and pretend that I don't
have to go to the bathroom.

23
00:00:52,752 --> 00:00:54,482
(Bernadette:)Howard, do something.

24
00:00:54,554 --> 00:01:03,024
(Howard:)I'm on it.

